exports[`rendering of the Markdown forms on the site callout-folded: A callout with a minus is folded and one with a plus is open, both can be folded (REN-01). The fold state is a details element, the mark of the reading view of Obsidian (data-callout-fold), or its classes (is-collapsible, is-collapsed). 1`] = `
"<h1 id="folded-callouts">Folded callouts</h1>
<details class="callout" data-callout="faq" data-callout-fold="-"><summary class="callout-title">Why mulch?</summary><div class="callout-content"><p>Mulch keeps the water in the soil.</p></div></details>
<details class="callout" data-callout="tip" data-callout-fold="+" open><summary class="callout-title">Open by default</summary><div class="callout-content"><p>Mulch in late spring.</p></div></details>"
`;

