exports[`rendering of the Markdown forms on the site headings-same-text: Two headings with the same text get distinct, stable ids; a link to the second one names its parent heading (\`#Autumn#Tasks\`) and reaches that heading, the form that the current site reads (URL-14, OPEN-15). 1`] = `
